<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle close steady -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle close steady -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers moderately active on a small midweek supply. Both classes steady.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1425 lbs 66.00-66.75. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 65.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2</p>
<p>63.50-65.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: High Select and Choice 2-3 1050-1250 lbs 65.00-66.75, some new crop 64.00. Select and Choice 2-3 950-1100</p>
<p>lbs 64.00-65.00. Select 1-2 63.00-64.00.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
